# The script-level actions, with no pad at all:
#   PILOT_FLAGS='--pad none --focus off' tools/game.sh pilot run script-actions
# Each is acknowledged by the plugin and checked on the state. This is the
# first-run test of the names docs/research/engine/autopilot.md tags as
# untested: every step is optional, so one run reports all that fail
# (warnings), and the routine itself only fails without a target.
limit 180
needs veh == 0
check savelock == 1
cmd god on
if npcs == 0
  cmd npc spawn 1
end
until npcs > 0 timeout 15
act target nearest
check tid != 0
show
# Look: the view must end on the target.
optional act look target 2
wait 1.5
optional face target tolerance 3 timeout 1
# A quickhack, while the target stands.
optional act hack
optional expect hacks: our upload timeout 5
# Draw, fire, reload.
optional act equip weapon
optional until weapon == 1 timeout 6
optional act fire 0.6
optional until thp < 100 timeout 3
optional until firing == 0 timeout 3
optional act reload
# Health down and up.
optional act hurt 30
optional until hp < 80 timeout 3
optional act heal
optional until hp > 80 timeout 5
# The operating system (a Sandevistan slows time).
optional act ability
optional until dilated == 1 timeout 3
optional act ability off
optional act equip holster
optional until weapon == 0 timeout 6
# The car: called, entered at the wheel, AutoDrive asked, left.
optional act summon
optional until car > 0 and car < 20 timeout 40
optional act mount
optional until veh == 1 and seat == driver timeout 12
optional act autodrive on
optional until auto == 1 timeout 3
optional act autodrive off
optional act exit
optional until veh == 0 timeout 10
act target none
cmd god off
show
